  },
  {
    "id": 4001069020220,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "はるきちゃんとのレッスンかー\r\nすっごく頑張れそう──！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106902/4001069020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ\r\n喜んでくれてよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "1002",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069020230,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "……あ、そういえば──",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106902/4001069020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069020240,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "斑鳩ルカちゃんって\r\n普段どんなレッスンをしてるの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106902/4001069020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、ルカか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069020250,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "うん\r\nソロ活動をしてる先輩だから、勉強になるかなーって",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106902/4001069020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\nそうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……今度、機会があったら\r\n見学とかしてみるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069020260,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "うん──！\r\nやったーっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106902/4001069020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、まぁ\r\nルカが了承してくれたらなんだが……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069020270,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "……？\r\nうん",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106902/4001069020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069020280,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "──あ、でも、あたしとはレベルが違いすぎて\r\nショック受けたらどうしよう",
